# --- Content-leak guard (see tools/check-content-leak) ---------------------
# User-imported game content must never enter the repository. These patterns
# mirror tools/check-content-leak/patterns.json; the CI guard is the backstop
# in case someone force-adds a file past .gitignore.
**/imported/**
*.userpkg.json
*.userpkg/
